flowchart TD
    Call["<b>BPF call site</b><br/>source names a helper or a __ksym kfunc<br/><b>handoff:</b> loader/verifier resolves the target<br/><b>state:</b> call instruction in BPF bytecode"]

    Helper["<b>helper path</b><br/>compiler encodes a stable BPF_FUNC_* UAPI number<br/><b>verification:</b> program-type helper table<br/>supplies arg and return prototypes<br/><b>state:</b> runtime dispatches via fixed helper table"]

    Kfunc["<b>kfunc path</b><br/>libbpf resolves a BTF symbol<br/>from __ksym relocation<br/><b>verification:</b> BTF signature, flags,<br/>acquire/release rules must match<br/><b>state:</b> calls in-kernel function;<br/>availability can vary"]

    Result["<b>same instruction shape, different contract</b><br/>helpers are stable UAPI;<br/>kfuncs are typed kernel extension points<br/><b>state:</b> load succeeds only if target<br/>is allowed for this program"]

    Call --> Helper --> Result
    Call --> Kfunc --> Result

    classDef root fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,stroke-width:2px
    classDef helper fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706,stroke-width:2px
    classDef kfunc fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class Call,Result root
    class Helper helper
    class Kfunc kfunc
